export anchor PlayfulPastelStyle:
    number: 4
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Playful pastel
    idea: A friendly toy box of candy pastel blocks, chunky round corners and soft blobs that makes project work feel light and encouraging.
    base: light
    palette:
        cream: #fffaf3, the page background
        plum: #2b2645, text, headings and the current nav pill
        dusk: #5a5470, hints, dates and meta text
        grape: #6a3fd4, the primary button, progress fill, this week's chart bars and the focus ring
        grapeDeep: #4b2aa3, links and the ledge under the primary button
        mint: #c8f0dc, a summary tile and the On track pill with #1d6b47 text
        peach: #ffd9c7, a summary tile, the chart block and the Marketing tag
        lilac: #e3d9ff, the greeting block and the Design tag
        butter: #fff0b8, a summary tile, the bell button and the At risk pill with #8a4b00 text
        sky: #d3ecff, a summary tile and the Engineering tag
        cherry: #b3243f, the Behind pill text on #ffd6dc, the overdue count and the bell badge
        blush: #fde4ef, the background blob behind the top right corner
    type:
        Rounded system sans for everything, ui-rounded, SF Pro Rounded,
        Arial Rounded MT Bold, system-ui, sans-serif. Sizes are 48px
        extra bold for the greeting, 56px extra bold tight summary
        numbers with tabular figures, 34px extra bold card percentages,
        26px extra bold section titles, 20px extra bold card titles, 16px
        regular body at 1.5 line height, 14px bold pills and 13px meta.
    layout:
        A top bar with the brand, search, a round bell, the user face and
        the New project button, then the nav as a white pill strip on its
        own row. A hero row pairs a big lilac greeting block with a two by
        two grid of pastel summary tiles. Below, a two to one grid holds
        six white project cards in two columns beside a peach chart block
        and a stack of activity bubbles. A pink blob peeks in at the top
        right. Below 1000px everything stacks, and below 640px the cards
        go to one column and the search takes a full row.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 16px between tiles and cards, 22 to 40px padding inside blocks, 40px between sections.
    density: Airy. Big blocks and big numbers, about four project cards per screen.
    corners: 20 to 48px on blocks, with one tighter 10px corner on each block so it wobbles like a blob. Buttons, fields, pills, nav and progress bars are fully round.
    borders: None on blocks. Fields carry a 3px #eadfce border. Last week's chart bars are white with a 2px plum outline.
    shadows: No blur. A flat 6 to 8px ledge straight down, #f1e8da under white cards and pills, #4b2aa3 under the grape button.
    icons:
        Line icons at 1.25em with a fat 2.4 round stroke. Status pills use
        filled shapes with a white mark, a circle with a tick for On track,
        a rounded triangle with a bang for At risk and a rounded square
        with a dash for Behind. People show as pastel initial faces.
    focus: A 4px grape outline offset 3px. A focused field gets a grape border and a 4px #d6c8ff ring.
    tone: Warm and encouraging in sentence case, such as Hi Mara, nice work this week, need a little love and See them all.
